{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>MemoJoin 是一款專為 iPhone 與 iPad 設計的錄音合併工具，適合需要整理講座、訪談、會議或語音筆記的使用者。你可以在裝置上將多段錄音排列成正確順序，並合併為單一 M4A 檔案。App 介面目前僅提供英文。現正限時免費，原價 US $1.99。</p>\n\n<h2>排列裁剪與匯出</h2>\n<p>透過「檔案」匯入 M4A、AAC、MP3 或 WAV 錄音，亦可從「語音備忘錄」的分享選單加入片段。排列講座、訪談、會議、語音筆記及 Podcast 片段順序，裁剪頭尾並試聽銜接處，最後匯出單一 M4A。所有處理都在裝置上完成，不會上傳音訊，亦不改動原始檔案，且沒有帳號、廣告、訂閱或追蹤。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-694-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-695-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-696-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-697-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-698-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-699-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：MemoJoin：合併錄音</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-12T04:39:09.757644+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":333,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}